OL,3,GNEWSAPolice disclosed domestic abuse
OL,4,Avictim's address
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reprimand has been issued to
OL,7,FStaffordshire Police after it disclosed
OL,8,Fa domestic abuse victim's home address
OL,9,Fto their alleged abuser.
OL,11,FThe force issued a notice - intended to
OL,12,Fprotect a victim - which included the
OL,13,Fdetails, when it was served on the
OL,14,Falleged perpetrator following their
OL,15,Frelease from prison, the Information
OL,16,FCommission's Office [ICO] stated.
OL,18,FIt also said the data breach in 2024
OL,19,Fcaused serious distress to the victim,
OL,20,Fwho had moved home on several
OL,21,Foccasions.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
