OL,3,GNEWSAPolice disclosed domestic abuse
OL,4,Avictim's address
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaffordshire Police had since made
OL,7,Fimprovements including increasing
OL,8,Fcompletion rates for relevant training,
OL,9,Faccording to the regulator. The force
OL,10,Fsaid it remained "committed to learning
OL,11,Ffrom this case".
